  "_doc": "Owner decision D-15 (robot/body/hip-shell/DECISIONS.md, A-12): a contact at a pose where every joint of one group stands at (or past) an end of its manifest range_deg at once is a controller self-collision limit, not a design target. clearance and collision_sweep still measure such poses but report their contacts apart (controller_limit_contacts), never as design overlaps. groups: lists of full joint names of one side; the group of their mirror joints (checks.relations.joint_mirrors) counts too. end_tol_deg: how close to a range end counts as at the end (a pose past the end counts too).",
  "groups": [
   [
    "R_hip_yaw",
    "R_hip_pitch",
    "R_hip_roll"
   ]
  ],
  "end_tol_deg": 0.5
